&lt;li&gt;12+ years of programming experience. Deep battle-tested experience with high-scale messaging/streaming systems and distributed processing engines (handling several thousand events/sec minimum).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of high-level service design, with a proven ability to model complex interfaces and internals in a properly modular, composable, and extensible way.&lt;/li&gt;
