&lt;li&gt;An active &quot;AI story&quot;—demonstrated, hands-on experience identifying, prototyping, and deploying GenAI/LLM solutions to solve real-world engineering or data processing challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profound technical depth in distributed systems, high-scale ingestion, and cutting-edge cloud-native architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superb communication and problem-solving skills, with a natural inclination to mentor others and a relentless drive for operational excellence&lt;/li&gt;
