&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Renewals &amp;amp; Quoting Strategy &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is on a mission to secure and accelerate the world&#39;s AI transformation. Rubrik (NYSE: RBRK), the Security and AI Operations Company, leads at the intersection of data protection, cyber resilience, and enterprise AI acceleration. With Zero Trust Data Security™, Rubrik helps organizations achieve business resilience against cyberattacks, malicious insiders, and operational disruptions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik&#39;s Renewals &amp;amp; Quoting Strategy &amp;amp; Operations team sits at the intersection of commercial strategy, systems, and execution, translating go-to-market priorities into the operational infrastructure that drives predictable, scalable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team spans renewal operations and quoting, and works closely with Customer Success, Sales, Finance, and Product so that every renewal and new business deal is handled with speed, accuracy, and strategic intent. We&#39;re a high-impact team in a period of active build, which means the work is visible, the problems are real, and there&#39;s a genuine opportunity to shape how this function grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Director of Renewals &amp;amp; Quoting Strategy, you will be the senior-most leader of our India team and a strategic right hand to the Senior Director of Global Renewals &amp;amp; Quoting Operations. You will take our India-based Renewal Operations, Data Assurance and Quote Desk teams to the next level of scale, rigor, and impact.. This role is ideal for someone with a consulting, strategy, or operations background who wants to own solutions in a fast-paced SaaS environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the Foundations of the Renewals Business&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement the systems, policies, and processes that enable renewals to scale, with clear rules of engagement, strong governance, and a great experience for sales and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop quoting frameworks and standards for multi-year, co-term, and mid-term expansion scenarios that maximize ARR retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with IT, RevOps, and Finance to define requirements for system enhancements, integrations, and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create playbooks, guidelines, and standard operating procedures that make excellence repeatable across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evolve and Lead Our Data Quality Function&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the next chapter for the team responsible for the accuracy and integrity of the data powering global renewals operations, supporting a large global base of account executives and renewal sales professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the standard of the function through clear data definitions, quality metrics, audit rhythms, and governance controls across CRM and renewal systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shift the team from reactive clean-up to proactive, preventive, and increasingly automated data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn data insights into action for sales leadership, and partner with Business Intelligence so reporting meets business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the Quote Desk Center of Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategy, service standards, and quality bar of our India-based Quote Desk, which serves sales teams worldwide, and scale it into a recognized center of excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of the Quote Desk and build trusted relationships with the sales leaders who rely on it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Streamline end-to-end workflows from opportunity identification to quote to close, reducing cycle times and improving accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence and Partner Across the Business&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with India renewals sales leadership and senior stakeholders across Sales and Finance globally, bringing structure, data, and a clear point of view.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate high-stakes conversations and competing priorities with poise, and align leaders around trade-offs and decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present renewal performance, forecasts, and operational insights to senior leadership in partnership with the Senior Director.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and Inspire the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attract and hire exceptional talent, and set a higher bar for what great looks like across roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop high-potential people into future leaders, building clear career paths and strong succession.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the overall caliber, capability, and culture of the India team over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in Management Consulting, Strategy &amp;amp; Operations, Sales/Renewal Operations, or Business Operations, ideally within a high-growth technology or SaaS business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of people leadership, including hiring, developing, and retaining high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building, scaling, or transforming an operations, data quality, or shared-services team that supports a large sales organization, including raising talent quality and operating standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting up or scaling a center of excellence in India, including driving adoption and stakeholder buy-in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence senior sales and finance leaders across geographies, including through difficult conversations and pushback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in ambiguity, with exceptional prioritization and problem-solving skills and a high degree of ownership and autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills (written, oral, and presentation), with the ability to simplify complexity for any audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with experience driving insight through tools such as Excel, Google Sheets, Tableau, Salesforce, or Clari.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills, including defining and executing against timelines, dependencies, and risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.A./B.S. degree; MBA or equivalent advanced degree highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CPQ tools (e.g., Salesforce CPQ) and/or forecasting platforms such as Clari.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with renewal quoting workflows, including multi-year and co-term deal structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of SaaS renewal metrics: ARR, NRR, GRR, churn rate, renewal rate, and pipeline coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to subscription lifecycle management, contract data, and revenue recognition concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of SQL or Python for data extraction and ad hoc analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role:&lt;/strong&gt; If you&#39;re ready to take real ownership of execution, with a seat at the table, a team to build, and a business to shape, this is that opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-DR2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
