&lt;p&gt;Location: Bangalore, India (Onsite)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a globally distributed, award-winning design organization of 70 talented individuals—including product designers, UX writers, technical writers, and UX researchers—spread across the U.S., Israel, and India. As our company and product portfolio rapidly grow, it&#39;s essential to scale our user experience and technical documentation strategically.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Bangalore based Senior Technical Writer to deliver high-quality technical product documentation. In this role, you&#39;ll orchestrate, create, and maintain important technical content that helps our customers succeed and drives business impact. You’ll collaborate with cross-functional partners across the company to deliver high-quality, high-impact technical content within the product experience and across our documentation platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📺 Learn more about our product and team:&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sohPrgI1eZU&quot;&gt; Watch Video&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, write, and maintain clear, consistent, and user-focused documentation that helps our customers achieve their goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret complex technology and customer needs to plan and deliver high-quality technical content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to improving the overall technical content experience as an integral part of the product experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build collaborative relationships with Product Management, Engineering, and Design partners to deliver documentation based on user needs. Embed in the development process to plan and deliver proactively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uphold a high level of quality by following and contributing to documentation guidelines, standards, and templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistency and quality in team output through peer reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI-powered tools and workflows to increase team efficiency and output quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance multiple competing priorities effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modernize legacy documentation to reflect new features, use cases, and usability improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to an inclusive, psychologically safe team culture where all voices are valued and contributions are recognized.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring to the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-8 years of experience in technical writing, preferably in an enterprise software, SaaS, cloud, hardware, or data center environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to quickly grasp and distill complex technical concepts related to storage, virtualization, networking, cloud solutions, hardware, and data security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems thinking, technical curiosity, and a proven ability to work with empathy, ownership, and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple, concurrent documentation projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bias for action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for technology and for customer success, with a user-centric approach and mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to embrace challenges and improve on what we deliver and how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating in ambiguity and evolving environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A learning mindset—curious, growth-oriented, and resilient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills with a collaborative approach to problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a modern documentation environment, including DITA/XML,&amp;nbsp; GitHub, and Claude Code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working with JIRA or similar project management tools is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
