&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience applying AI/ML tools to quality engineering — e.g., LLM-based test/code generation, AI coding assistants (Copilot, Cursor, Claude Code), self-healing test frameworks, or AI-driven anomaly/log analysis&lt;/li&gt;
