&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating SaaS platforms serving large-scale customer workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within Kubernetes-based microservices environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting globally distributed production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GitOps and ArgoCD.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing AI-assisted operational tooling or automation workflows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
