&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6027&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1ab5ab267d5f&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;7+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of professional experience in &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Software Development&lt;/strong&gt;, with a strong focus on backend systems and distributed applications.&lt;/p&gt;
