&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable expertise in customer-facing technical support, site reliability engineering (SRE), or cloud systems engineering within enterprise software environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep practical knowledge of container orchestration platforms (such as Kubernetes, OpenShift, or VMware Tanzu) and major public cloud ecosystems (such as AWS or Azure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with modern Infrastructure-as-Code and DevOps tools (such as Terraform, Ansible, Chef, or Puppet) and Linux to troubleshoot complex software stacks and automation workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding cross-functional communication and technical consultation skills, with a track record of effectively managing customer escalations and translating technical challenges into actionable engineering solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to participate in team shift structures and on-call rotation schedules as required to support mission-critical global infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
