&lt;p&gt;This person is also responsible for ensuring Everpure Enterprise account teams are effectively qualifying and positioning Analytics &amp;amp; AI opportunities in their sales area as well as providing enablement internally and externally to our channel partner community. The position requires the ability to work cross functionally across Solutions, Marketing, Alliances, Engineering, Enablement, Sales, etc. to align initiatives and go to market campaigns while maintaining technical expertise in all new and upcoming solutions in the space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The selected candidate MUST reside in Illinois, Wisconsin, Minnesota, Michigan, Indiana or Missouri.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
