&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;Firmware &amp;amp; Embedded Systems Mastery: Deep hands-on experience developing low-level embedded software or device firmware using C/C++ and Python, with a strong understanding of microcontrollers, SoCs, or hardware bring-up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;Storage &amp;amp; Flash Domain Expertise: Solid background in NAND flash, SSD device firmware architecture, or media management policies, alongside a practical command of software/firmware test and release lifecycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration &amp;amp; Problem Solving: Demonstrated ability to analyze complex hardware-software interactions and communicate effectively across interdisciplinary engineering teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_e91a7574392b8d6b-20&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;Location: &lt;span class=&quot;citation-1&quot;&gt;We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-1&quot;&gt;Bengaluru&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-1 citation-end-1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;office in compliance with Pure’s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved lea&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;ve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
