&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SHOULD YOU ACCEPT THIS CHALLENGE...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
