&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Scale Event-Driven AI Pipelines:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect asynchronous processing systems using Kafka and RabbitMQ to trigger dynamic infrastructure scaling and handle high-volume data streams like long-running document ingestion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ensure Reproducible Deployments:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain &quot;Golden Path&quot; deployment standards using Docker and Kubernetes to keep models, prompts, and application code perfectly synchronized across all environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Optimize AI Observability &amp;amp; Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage GPU workloads, distributed caches (Redis), and vector databases while monitoring system health and AI-specific metrics like token latency and model drift.&lt;/p&gt;
