&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Execution and Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Provide technical direction and leadership to a team of highly motivated engineers, fostering a culture of technical excellence, and ensuring timely delivery of high-quality, high-impact performance results.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
