&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Linux Systems Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Expert-level proficiency with Linux systems, including in-depth knowledge of the network configuration, storage stack, system settings, and common command-line utilities crucial for performance tuning.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Ownership and Mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Demonstrated ability to lead, mentor, and provide architectural direction to software and performance engineers, elevating the technical quality and impact of the entire team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
