&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;As Senior Product Manager for FlashArray Foundation, you will shape and accelerate the core platform roadmap for Purity//FA, the operating system powering our industry-defining enterprise storage solutions. Your mission is to redefine storage simplicity and resilience by delivering high-performance, zero-downtime capabilities directly to global enterprise data centers. Collaborating closely with Engineering, Hardware, and Office of the CTO architects, you will pioneer next-generation hardware/software co-design that keeps mission-critical applications running continuously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive Core OS &amp;amp; Platform Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the end-to-end vision, roadmap, and business impact for Purity//FA core services, delivering non-disruptive upgrades, high-availability failover, and operational simplicity to meet enterprise SLAs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Architect Protocol &amp;amp; Hardware Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate enterprise market needs across FC, iSCSI, and NVMe-oF/TCP into actionable product definitions, partnering with hardware and software engineering to execute seamless controller and media co-design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Turn Telemetry into Scalable Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Evaluate customer fleet telemetry, benchmark data, and workload trends to pinpoint latency and throughput bottlenecks, prioritizing high-impact enhancements that measurably improve fleet-wide reliability and speed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lead Cross-Functional Alignment &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Unify Engineering, QA, Hardware, and Architecture teams through crisp decision frameworks, balancing customer value, technical debt, release velocity, and risk mitigation from concept to GA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Enable Field &amp;amp; Market Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Technical Marketing, Solutions Engineers, and sales teams to deliver compelling technical positioning, architectural deep-dives, and competitive intelligence that showcase FlashArray&#39;s operational advantages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
