&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Deep Storage Systems &amp;amp; Protocols Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Applied understanding of block storage protocols (FC, iSCSI, NVMe-oF, NVMe/TCP) and storage OS principles (such as controller/media behaviors, high-availability clustering, and non-disruptive upgrades), enabling peer-level credibility with principal engineers and architects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
