&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborative Influence &amp;amp; Strategic Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional ability to synthesize diverse stakeholder inputs, build consensus across distributed cross-functional teams without direct authority, and communicate technical narratives clearly to both executive and technical audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
