&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;This is an in-office role based out of our Bangalore office, requiring daily onsite attendance in accordance with Pure Storage’s workplace policies.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
