&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Sourcing Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of progressive experience in strategic sourcing, procurement, or supply chain management, ideally within global supplier ecosystems and complex spend categories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Negotiation &amp;amp; Legal Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated success leading high-stakes commercial negotiations alongside a solid working knowledge of contract lifecycle management, legal terms, and compliance frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;
