&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Stakeholder Alignment &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong communication and presentation skills with a proven ability to collaborate with, influence, and align cross-functional senior leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Analytical Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience utilizing procurement platforms, spend analysis tools, and performance dashboards to turn raw data into actionable sourcing strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
