&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Technical Services Engineer Representative at Everpure, you will work on problems of diverse scope where analysis will include hardware, software, and environmental factors within our Product lines. &lt;br&gt;Our Support Engineers utilize their deep technical expertise to troubleshoot customer issues and resolve them. &lt;br&gt;Ability to perform implementation work such as Software and Hardware upgrades and RMA dispatch.&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt;Our culture is built on &lt;strong&gt;Persistence, Creativity, Teamwork, Ownership, and Customer First.&lt;/strong&gt; You will be expected to live these values every day while collaborating closely with peers across Support, Engineering, and the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own, troubleshoot, and resolve customer technical issues across all severity levels using collaboration and troubleshooting best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively understand customer requirements and expectations to deliver effective solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate with customers in a clear, concise, and professional manner across all interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain knowledge base (KB) articles and FAQs for both internal and customer facing use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple support cases and priorities simultaneously in a fast paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a customer advocate by driving issues internally and representing the company externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate within a team environment, contributing to shared goals while continuously learning and growing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in weekend, public holiday, and on call support rotations as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a positive team culture and bring enthusiasm to your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work primarily from the Bangalore office in alignment with company policies, unless on approved leave, travel, or remote exceptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on experience in customer facing roles and/or technical support environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workdays include weekends, with an expectation to adapt to rotational shift schedules within a 24/7 support environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer service mindset with excellent interpersonal and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid technical aptitude with attention to detail and problem solving abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of enterprise storage concepts (SAN, NAS, Fibre Channel, Ethernet, IP, iSCSI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand major OS / platform (e.g., Linux, VMware, Windows) and willingness to deepen expertise over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using CLI/SSH and common tooling to read &amp;amp; interpret logs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to take initiative and work both independently and collaboratively within a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and time management skills to handle multiple priorities effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A growth mindset with a desire to learn, improve, and adapt in a dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
