&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Deal Support: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Intervene directly to unblock strategic customer deals where partners are the primary delivery vehicle, providing deep technical expertise and solution architecture guidance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Ecosystem &amp;amp; Events&lt;/strong&gt;: Represent Anthropic at partner events such as GSI customer workshops, summits, and industry conferences. Lead or support partner-specific developer events, hackathons, and technical enablement sessions, especially for technically native communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Feedback:&lt;/strong&gt; Validate and gather feedback on Anthropic&#39;s products and offerings, especially as they relate to partner use cases and deployment patterns, and deliver this feedback to relevant Anthropic teams to inform product roadmap and partner strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
