&lt;p&gt;As a key member of the Information Security organization, you will partner closely with Product Security, Engineering, Security Operations, and Infrastructure teams to proactively assess risk, validate security controls, and strengthen Netskope&#39;s overall security posture.&lt;/p&gt;
