&lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve production issues, and drive improvements to observability, reliability, and incident response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve engineering processes, CI/CD, and developer tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
