&lt;li&gt;12+ years of software development experience, including building enterprise-grade backend systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level Python, with strong experience building production backend services and REST APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with AWS and cloud architecture (e.g., compute, storage, networking, messaging, IAM, managed data services)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong distributed systems fundamentals: scalability, fault tolerance, concurrency, data consistency, and event-driven or asynchronous architectures&lt;/li&gt;
