&lt;p class=&quot;gmail-mb-2 gmail-whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;The IT Tooling team sits within IT Support &amp;amp; Services (ITSS) and builds the automations that power ITSS&#39;s own operations. Our in-house bot, Ask IT, deflects the majority of company-wide IT requests before they reach a human. Beyond that, we automate ITSS&#39;s core day-to-day workflows — ticket triage, access reviews, onboarding and offboarding — which employees experience as self-service. You&#39;ll own technical domains within the IT Tooling platform and partner with regional IT teams across APAC, EMEA, and AMER through platforms including n8n, Jira, Okta, Airflow, and Temporal.&lt;/p&gt;
