&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profile&lt;/strong&gt; – Senior Staff Software Engineer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Druva delivers Data Protection and Management for the cloud era. Druva Cloud Platform is built on AWS and offered as-a-Service; customers drive down costs by up to 50 percent by freeing themselves from the burden of unnecessary hardware, capacity planning, and software management. Druva is trusted worldwide by over 4,000 companies at the forefront of embracing the cloud. Druva is a privately held company headquartered in Sunnyvale, California, and is funded by Sequoia Capital, Viking Global Investors, Tenaya Capital, Riverwood Capital, and Nexus Partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please do visit us at:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/druva/mycompany/&quot;&gt;https://www.linkedin.com/company/druva/mycompany/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
