&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.druva.com/blog/&quot;&gt;https://www.druva.com/blog/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Data team within Foundation processes data at scale. It builds and operates tools that scan petabytes of data to extract insights. The team builds indices and views for semi-structured data to facilitate analytics, using both in-house and off-the-shelf tools.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
