&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Record structured video footage of assigned tasks using a camera device (iPhone on chest&lt;br&gt;mount)&lt;br&gt;• Follow the prescribed annotation format — clearly stating task names, commands, and&lt;br&gt;action sequences during recording&lt;br&gt;• Perform physical actions accurately as per the task list assigned for the shift&lt;br&gt;• Submit demo recordings within the designated time window for quality review&lt;br&gt;• Maintain consistent quality standards as trained — script compliance, action accuracy, and&lt;br&gt;environment setup&lt;br&gt;• Follow guidance from the Supervisor, Trainer, and Live QA during the shift&lt;br&gt;• Complete the same assigned task for the full shift duration as per the project requirement&lt;br&gt;• Household setup: perform everyday household tasks (arranging items, picking and placing&lt;br&gt;objects, etc.)&lt;br&gt;• Kitchen setup: perform kitchen-related tasks (appliance handling, ingredient placement,&lt;br&gt;cooking actions, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Minimum qualification: 10+2 (HSC) or equivalent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Freshers welcome — no prior experience required&lt;br&gt;• Basic smartphone proficiency — comfortable handling and operating an iPhone&lt;br&gt;• Good physical fitness — role involves standing, moving, and performing repeated physical&lt;br&gt;actions during the shift&lt;br&gt;• Ability to follow structured instructions precisely and consistently&lt;br&gt;• Punctual, reliable, and able to commit to fixed shift timings&lt;br&gt;• Comfortable working in kitchen or household environments depending on location&lt;br&gt;assignment&lt;br&gt;• Clear verbal communication — able to state task names and commands audibly on camera&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• ₹25,000 fixed monthly salary&lt;br&gt;• Performance-based daily incentives on top of fixed salary&lt;br&gt;• Full training provided before Day 1 — no prior experience needed&lt;br&gt;• Structured work environment with dedicated Supervisor and Trainer support&lt;br&gt;• Opportunity to be part of a high-growth AI data collection project&lt;br&gt;Shift preference (morning or evening) and location (Airbnb or kitchen) will be discussed and&lt;br&gt;confirmed during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Our Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
