&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;About Instawork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2015,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instawork.com&quot;&gt;Instawork&lt;/a&gt; is the nation’s leading online labor marketplace for food services, hospitality, light industry, and logistics, connecting more than 7M skilled workers with local restaurants, hotels, warehouses, stadiums, and more. Our AI-powered platform serves thousands of businesses across more than 50 major markets in the United States and Canada. We&#39;re not just helping fill shifts, we&#39;re supporting local economies—and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Instawork has been featured by CBS News, The Wall Street Journal, The Washington Post, and the Associated Press. Forbes included us on their Next Billion Dollar Startups list; RetailTech Breakthrough named us Workforce Hiring Solution of the Year for 2025; and Inc. 5000 recognized us as one of the country&#39;s top 10% fastest-growing companies two years in a row. But what matters most is our impact. We&#39;re solving real problems for real people, and we’re doing it at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team to help us build something that matters! We’re looking for superstars who want to help us shape the future of work. With hubs in San Francisco, Bangalore, and Chicago, city offices in New York and Phoenix, we&#39;re back to working together in-person five days a week because we believe the best ideas happen when great people collaborate face-to-face. We also value diverse perspectives and encourage applications from candidates of all backgrounds.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to make an impact? Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.instawork.com/about&quot;&gt;www.instawork.com/about&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://info.instawork.com/legal/california-personnel-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Personnel Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instawork is on a mission to create meaningful economic opportunities for skilled hourly professionals in communities around the globe. Our AI-powered labor marketplace helps local businesses scale, and enables global technology companies to push the frontiers of robotics and AI. Backed by world-class investors like Benchmark, Spark Capital, Craft Ventures, Greylock, Y Combinator, and others, we’re looking for exceptional talent to reimagine the way the world works.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Be part of a cutting-edge AI data collection project, capturing real-world actions and annotating&lt;br&gt;video footage to train next-generation robotics.&lt;br&gt;📍 Location: Marathalli,&amp;nbsp;Bengaluru&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍Shift: Night Shift&amp;nbsp;Options: 8:30 PM –&amp;nbsp;3:00 AM | 9:00 PM –&amp;nbsp;6:00 AM&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍 Salary: ₹27,000/month +&amp;nbsp;Incentives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍 Work Location: Kitchen / In-Office&amp;nbsp;Setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for motivated individuals to join our night shift data collection team for an AI&lt;br&gt;robotics project. As a Data Collector &amp;amp; Annotator, you will record structured video footage of&lt;br&gt;real-world tasks and annotate the recordings to help train robotic systems.&lt;br&gt;This role operates across two night shift environments — a kitchen setup and an in-office setup&lt;br&gt;— depending on your assigned location. Your shift and location will be confirmed at the time of&lt;br&gt;onboarding.&lt;br&gt;No prior experience in AI or technology is required. Full training is provided before you begin&lt;br&gt;work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Record structured video footage of assigned tasks using a camera device (iPhone on chest&lt;br&gt;mount)&lt;br&gt;• Follow the prescribed annotation format — clearly stating task names, commands, and&lt;br&gt;action sequences during recording&lt;br&gt;• Perform physical actions accurately as per the task list assigned for the shift&lt;br&gt;• Submit demo recordings within the designated time window for quality review&lt;br&gt;• Maintain consistent quality standards as trained — script compliance, action accuracy, and&lt;br&gt;environment setup&lt;br&gt;• Follow guidance from the Supervisor and Trainer during the shift&lt;br&gt;• Complete the same assigned task for the full shift duration as per the project requirement&lt;br&gt;• Kitchen setup: perform kitchen-related tasks (appliance handling, ingredient placement,&lt;br&gt;cooking actions, etc.)&lt;br&gt;• In-office setup: perform data collection using a camera device followed by annotation of&lt;br&gt;recorded videos&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Minimum qualification: 10+2 (HSC) or equivalent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Freshers welcome — no prior experience required&lt;br&gt;• Basic smartphone proficiency — comfortable handling and operating an iPhone&lt;br&gt;• Good physical fitness — role involves standing, moving, and performing repeated physical&lt;br&gt;actions during the shift&lt;br&gt;• Ability to follow structured instructions precisely and consistently&lt;br&gt;• Must be comfortable working night shifts (8:30 PM – 6:00 AM depending on assignment)&lt;br&gt;• Punctual, reliable, and able to commit to fixed shift timings&lt;br&gt;• Clear verbal communication — able to state task names and commands audibly on camera&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• ₹27,000 fixed monthly salary — higher pay for night shift commitment&lt;br&gt;• Performance-based daily incentives on top of fixed salary&lt;br&gt;• Full training provided before Day 1 — no prior experience needed&lt;br&gt;• Structured work environment with dedicated Supervisor and Trainer support&lt;br&gt;• Opportunity to be part of a high-growth AI data collection project&lt;br&gt;Exact shift timing (8:30 PM – 3:00 AM or 9:00 PM – 6:00 AM) and location (kitchen or in-office)&lt;br&gt;will be confirmed during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Our Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Empathy, Trust &amp;amp; Candor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We put ourselves in the shoes of our colleagues and customers and don’t shy away from uncomfortable conversations, instead building trust through honest and direct feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Bias for Action&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We practice high-velocity decision-making, clear-eyed that we often operate with incomplete information. Growing quickly means it’s OK to be wrong, so long as we learn from our mistakes and course correct!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Always Be Learning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re a curious bunch, and with AI transforming our workplace we encourage everyone to learn from each other, compounding our knowledge and experience to help us change an entire industry.&lt;/p&gt;
