&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing fleet on street and also building and closing large B2B partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building a partnerships or business development function from the ground up is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong network across hospitality, logistics, manufacturing, warehousing, retail, marketplaces, or other labor-intensive industries is a major plus.&lt;/li&gt;
